{"id":"vod_sn_37474","vodId":"37474","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"神风怪盗贞德","name_cn":"神风怪盗贞德","date":"1999-01-01","year":"1999","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/c0ff7ffcab57a1f80846837574ebddd2.jpg"},"summary":"普通的女高中生日下部栗（桑岛法子 配音）一直以来的生活都不咸不淡，平淡但也快乐。直到有一天，她被告知她是圣女贞德的转世。知道这个事情的日下起初大感惊讶和不相信，但随之而来的各种魔法让她不得不认清这个现实。而这个特殊的身份自然赋予了她不得不完成的使命，她需要封印藏匿于四处的恶魔，防止它们危害人间，而这个正义的举动却遭到了误解。于是乎，贞德的前面被冠以了怪盗之名，成为了众多人追逐的对象，其中包括了怪盗辛巴达，也就是日下的同学名古屋稚空（千叶进步 配音）的追逐和保护。于是乎，一场场惊险的怪盗之旅在黑夜的上空开始。　　本片改编自漫画家种村有菜的同名漫画。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:52:46","playable":true,"episodeCount":44,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/PjkpgACdEU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/fQ2tZ4SEKY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xawhVzb1yV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/f2YukhVk5B1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/sDUvwvSgd71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/N7SgsKh9u01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/zsPKzXZFjq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uqLutCb4JB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/zkWyiJh36Q1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/B07p0spTnE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3bpdtGGG1q1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/67skSkiNM71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/NV3Zj3kiD61/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xAtFz3caid1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"